# Self-heal errors (always on — design principle)

**Golden sentence:** Every caught Studio error face can **summarize → Chat → fix**. When **Self-heal errors** is on in Settings → AI, that path **auto-fires** (deduped). Manual **Ask chat to fix** stays available on error faces either way.

Audience: **Studio chrome** (`apps/studio/**`). Not Host operator plane (ADR 0019) — that heals desk Host crash-loops. This principle is **product error → chat agent**.

## Law

| # | Law | Fail if |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | **One seam** — new error catch / overlay calls `requestSelfHeal` (or documents why not) | One-off “Retry only” with no chat path |
| 2 | **Pref** — auto-send gated by `ui.selfHealErrors` (default **off**) | Silent auto-chat without Settings toggle |
| 3 | **Summarize** — `summarizeSelfHealPrompt` pure; no raw dump-only paste without ask-to-fix | Paste stack with no “please fix” intent |
| 4 | **Dedupe** — auto path cools same signature (~60s) | Refresh / paint loops spam chat turns |
| 5 | **Manual always** — Ask chat to fix works with `force: true` even when auto off | Mode off removes all chat escape |

## Shape

```
error catch / face
 → requestSelfHeal({ source, title, detail, context }, { force? })
 → pure summarize + signature / cooldown
 → open Chat + sendMessage(prompt)
```

| Layer | Module |
| --- | --- |
| Pure | `packages/studio/studio-core/src/self-heal-error-pure.ts` |
| Pref | `StudioConfig.ui.selfHealErrors` |
| Connector | `apps/studio/client/errors/self-heal-error-connector.ts` |
| Settings | Settings → AI → Self-heal errors (`studioSwitch`) |

## Surfaces (extend — don't fork)

| Surface | Call |
| --- | --- |
| Website Preview start / iframe error | Live runtime CTA |
| Client / boot banner | Banner + `reportClientError` auto |
| New overlays / modals | Same `requestSelfHeal` |

Host-down / operator heal stays ADR 0019 — may still offer Ask chat when product wants it; do not replace operator exec with chat-only.

## Forbidden

| Don't | Why |
| --- | --- |
| Auto-send with pref off | Surprises users / burns turns |
| Heal-in-render storms without signature cooldown | Chat spam |
| Bare “Host” / deploy jargon in prompt face copy | `studio-product-copy` |
| Per-surface custom prompt builders | One pure summarizer |

## Agent checklist

- [ ] New error UI → `requestSelfHeal` (auto on paint when appropriate + Ask chat button)
- [ ] Pref still `ui.selfHealErrors`; Settings switch present
- [ ] Unit covers summarize + cooldown + force path
- [ ] Not a second Host-heal one-off

